[Rep] (2026-05-03T14:56:29.000Z) =
Hey, saw you wanted the blueprint. I'm curious, what are your primary goals=
 with your health and fitness

[Martin Pusztai] (2026-05-03T14:57:36.000Z) =
Hello. Thanks for responding so fast. I want to lose weight, build muscle =
and regain my mobility.

[AI] (2026-05-03T15:01:47.748Z) Those are solid =
targets man

[AI] (2026-05-03T15:01:55.442Z) How is the progress coming =
along with all of that so far?

[Martin Pusztai] (2026-05-03T15:03:15.000Z)=
 Well, I just started, so I can't say much yet. But I'm determined to =
achive it.

[AI] (2026-05-03T15:08:42.307Z) Love that drive man, taking =
that first step is huge.

[AI] (2026-05-03T15:08:55.116Z) Besides the =
physical side of things, how's your nutrition looking?

[Martin Pusztai] (2026-05-03T15:11:38.000Z) I'm trying to keep a priority =
to eat enough protein and to eat clean as much as I can. I'm also =
experimenting with different combinations of foods and cuisine.

[Martin Pusztai] (2026-05-03T15:13:28.000Z) My favourite so far is baked =
sweet potato loaded with chicken or beef and topped with eggs, avocado and =
some homemade sauce.

[AI] (2026-05-03T15:19:08.679Z) That honestly sounds =
delicious man, I'm curious

[AI] (2026-05-03T15:19:18.826Z) What would you =
say has been the biggest struggle or challenge you're facing currently?

[Martin Pusztai] (2026-05-03T15:22:22.000Z) Basically, I am starting my =
life all over. I moved back with my parents temporarily, I started a new =
job and I broke up with my fianc=C3=A9e. I'm rebuilding myself from rock =
bottom. But that's a strong ass foundation for growth.

[Martin Pusztai] (2026-05-03T15:25:01.000Z) Physically, emotionally, =
financially, spiritually. Anything you can imagine, gets rebuilt.

[AI] (2026-05-03T15:29:04.183Z) That level of a total reset takes serious =
grit man.

[AI] (2026-05-03T15:29:12.222Z) Lots of guys I work with face =
similar hurdles, I'd be happy to offer you some help here if you want it

[Martin Pusztai] (2026-05-03T15:29:53.000Z) I would appreciate it, thank =
you.

[AI] (2026-05-03T15:34:25.111Z) Glad you're open to it man. I have a =
few ideas based on everything you shared but it'd take 10 paragraphs to =
type out here.

[AI] (2026-05-03T15:34:35.530Z) I can send a link to =
schedule a quick call today or tomorrow to go over the details and see if =
we're a good fit. Let me know if you want me to drop the link

[Martin Pusztai] (2026-05-03T15:48:07.000Z) Before I commit with working =
together, just want to know an estimate about the price. If it isn't in my =
budget, I don't want you to work unnecessarily.

[AI] (2026-05-03T15:52:54.=
059Z) I appreciate you looking out for my time man. Since the 6-month =
program is completely custom, the exact investment depends on the level of =
support you need.

[AI] (2026-05-03T15:53:02.025Z) We'd map out those =
numbers on a quick call. Are you still open to taking a look?

[Martin Pusztai] (2026-05-03T15:57:38.000Z) I'm down. But I live in Hungary=
 and so we are in totally different time zones. I'm 5 to 8 hours before you=
. If it's not an obstacle for you, we can speak tomorrow.

[You] (2026-05-03T16:09:25.574Z) No problem at all. I will send you the =
